### Topic 38 - Product CRUD API (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 1. List all products (3 are seeded at startup)
GET {{base}}

### 2. Count products
GET {{base}}/count

### 3. Get one product
GET {{base}}/1

### 4. Get a product that does not exist -> 404 ProblemDetail
GET {{base}}/99

### 5. Create a product -> 201 Created + Location header
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C Hub",
  "description": "7 ports, 100W pass-through",
  "sku": "HUB-007",
  "price": 34.90,
  "stock": 25
}

### 6. Create with invalid data -> 400 with fieldErrors
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "sku": "X",
  "price": 0,
  "stock": -1
}

### 7. Create with a duplicate SKU -> 409 Conflict
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Another mouse",
  "sku": "MOU-001",
  "price": 10.00,
  "stock": 1
}

### 8. Update product 4 (watch updatedAt change, createdAt stays)
PUT {{base}}/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C Hub Pro",
  "description": "8 ports",
  "sku": "HUB-007",
  "price": 39.90,
  "stock": 20
}

### 9. Delete product 4 -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{base}}/4
